<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Ride the Bus - Home</title>
  <link href="./dist/output.css" rel="stylesheet">
</head>

<body class="min-h-screen bg-gray-600">
  <nav class="flex items-center justify-between p-4">
    <div class="flex gap-3">
      <a href="/"
        class="px-6 py-2 bg-white text-gray-800 rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-gray-100 transition shadow-md">
        Home
      </a>
      <a href="/lobby"
        class="px-6 py-2 bg-purple-600 text-white rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-purple-700 transition shadow-md">
        Lobby-list
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="flex gap-3 items-center">
      <button
        class="px-6 py-2 bg-purple-600 text-white rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-purple-700 transition shadow-md">
        <%= user.username %>
      </button>
      <button
        class="w-10 h-10 bg-purple-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-purple-700 transition shadow-md">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path
            d="M12 12c2.21 0 4-1.79 4-4s-1.79-4-4-4-4 1.79-4 4 1.79 4 4 4zm0 2c-2.67 0-8 1.34-8 4v2h16v-2c0-2.66-5.33-4-8-4z" />
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center mt-20">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h1 class="text-white text-4xl font-bold mb-2">Ride the bus</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">Welcome <%= user.username %>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <button data-modal-target="rules-modal" data-modal-toggle="rules-modal"
        class="px-24 py-4 bg-purple-600 text-white text-lg font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-purple-700 transition shadow-lg text-center">Game
        rules</button>
      <a href="/lobby"
        class="px-24 py-4 bg-purple-600 text-white text-lg font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-purple-700 transition shadow-lg text-center">
        Lobby list
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="rules-modal" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"
    class="hidden fixed inset-0 z-[1000] flex items-center justify-center overflow-y-auto overflow-x-hidden">

    <!-- Backdrop -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/50" data-modal-hide="rules-modal"></div>

    <!-- Modal Container -->
    <div class="relative z-[1001] w-full max-w-2xl p-4">
      <div class="relative bg-gray-800 rounded-lg shadow-lg flex flex-col max-h-[80vh] overflow-hidden">

        <!-- Header -->
        <div
          class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 border-b border-gray-600 sticky top-0 bg-gray-800 z-10 rounded-t">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Game rules</h3>
          <button type="button"
            class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white rounded-lg text-sm w-8 h-8 flex justify-center items-center"
            data-modal-hide="rules-modal">
            <svg class="w-3 h-3" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14">
              <path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"
                d="m1 1 6 6m0 0 6 6M7 7l6-6M7 7l-6 6" />
            </svg>
          </button>
        </div>


        <div class="p-4 space-y-4 overflow-y-auto rounded-b-lg [&::-webkit-scrollbar]:w-2 [&::-webkit-scrollbar-track]:rounded-full [&::-webkit-scrollbar-track]:bg-gray-100 [&::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb]:rounded-full [&::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb]:bg-gray-30 dark:[&::-webkit-scrollbar-track]:bg-neutral-700 dark:[&::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb]:bg-neutral-500">

          <h2 class="text-white text-lg">Round 1</h2>
          <h3 class="text-white">Round 1 phase 1:</h3>
            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400"> In phase 1 of the first round you will
              guess what kind of color card you will get to guess a color red or black. Everytime you get a question wrong
              you have to take a sip of your drink of choice.</p>
          <h3 class="text-white">Round 1 phase 2:</h3>
            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">In phase 2 you will have to guess if the
              card is higher or lower then the first card you guessed. </p>
          <h3 class="text-white">Round 1 phase 3:</h3>
            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">In phase 3 you will guess if the card
              goes within the first 2 cards or if the card will be outside </p>
          <h3 class="text-white">Round 1 phase 4</h3>
            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Phase 4 you will have to choose the
              suits of the card next card </p>

          <h2 class="text-white">Round 2</h2>
            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">In this round you are gonna play with
              all of your cards a pyramid will form and once a card turns around and you have a matching card you will be
              able to throw your card onto the pile and you will be able to hand out sips. To other people if you get all
              the way to the end and you have no more cards you will be safe for the next round. If you end the round with
              the most cards then you will "Ride the bus"</p>

          <h2 class="text-white">Round 3</h2>
            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">If you get unlucky and make it into the
              bus 10 cards will be put down and you will have to keep guessing higher or lower untill you make it to the
              end everytime you fail you have to start over and take a sip. This will go on untill you finish</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>

</html>
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/flowbite/2.3.0/flowbite.min.js"></script>